{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "7c28e1197ed40af0f76133e7b4b4757f74b1e90b83e2477aea9c686e02cd4bbd", "ja": "うーん……勝ち負けは気にしなくていいと思う。\n今のはこう、根本的にみんなと種類が違うセクシーだ！", "zh": "嗯……我觉得不用在意输赢。\n刚才那种性感，根本就和大家不是一个类型的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1039_046rio", "source_sha256": "7a8690764a5811f0420e50f5506f2fc385fde52d5bee5021768b6b40cbc6c67b", "ja": "でも{$P$}くん、セクシービーストの\n胸ばっかり見てたじゃない！　説得力がないのよ！", "zh": "可是，{$P$}君，你刚才明明一直盯着性感野兽的胸部看！这样的话可没有说服力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1040_046rio", "source_sha256": "3be6cad763354f773c2dcbd37dca56e92b61f975198d8e108c2cf7190ab081bc", "ja": "私の胸は、全然見てくれないのに……。\n{$P$}くんのバカー！　ううっ……。", "zh": "明明完全没看我的胸……{$P$}先生，你这个大笨蛋！呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1041_039kon", "source_sha256": "6722aaf142aa1dbaafd13663b91c199c3421efff35a29da2bc92f88b00a4c56c", "ja": "たしかにセクシーの種類は違う。違うんだけど……\nあんなすごいのを見せつけられちゃうと、私も……。", "zh": "确实，性感的类型不一样。是不一样没错，可是……\n被人家炫耀那么厉害的身材，我也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "7c49e85c51eb9dcd5ec2765d195d862ede33495a7812dbc1ded9017e6cc3062d", "ja": "このみさん……莉緒……。\nいや、でも……。", "zh": "这个美……莉绪……  \n不，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1043_201xxx", "source_sha256": "0f3ab0192c2b8f876c71c9ecba75018c4f379be5f76974604c19d88d939bc103", "ja": "あの……元気を出してください！　私は\nおふたりのほうが、本物のセクシーだと思ってます！", "zh": "那个……请打起精神来！\n我觉得两位才是真正的性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1044_201xxx", "source_sha256": "a6fbcd40968214595f8c85514f5129963ff84f74fcab92ae9e2aaa31e1e647b6", "ja": "相談に乗っていただいて、今までよりもっと\nおふたりのことが好きになりました！　だから……。", "zh": "谢谢你们愿意听我倾诉，我比以前更喜欢两位了！所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1045_046rio", "source_sha256": "a6321f0b853af7d43ba222c895a0123b6af16d6c592ec14ca5b7351fc1f5c5fd", "ja": "詩花ちゃん……ありがと。\nなんだか励ましてもらっちゃったわね。", "zh": "诗花……谢谢你。\n没想到被你鼓励了一番呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1046_039kon", "source_sha256": "88ea34ecd2af57774522acc268e189fed36df8535d035c61bb0a4a831d084c39", "ja": "そうね……ありがとう、詩花ちゃん。\nでも私たちは、このままじゃダメなのよ……。", "zh": "是啊……谢谢你，诗花。\n但是我们不能就这样下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1047_046rio", "source_sha256": "99268b0e49e4b7fae95eac79043e746c7330db730d077fd596d9750afa584cd5", "ja": "このみ姉さん……？", "zh": "可奈姐姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1048_039kon", "source_sha256": "639c9f768630132797d4beb1fc07f48c6828f7fa9d4ec1423b3556eb4b654b66", "ja": "ごめんなさいね、詩花ちゃん……。\n私たち、セクシーを見つめ直す旅に出るわ！", "zh": "对不起哦，诗花……。\n我们要踏上重新审视性感的旅程了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1050_201xxx", "source_sha256": "4a5dcf9f27247b4f854b1e48963a82bf110e9699b1e5ecbc63796255856c19d2", "ja": "そんな！　おふたりとももう、\n私にセクシーの極意を教えてくださらないんですか？", "zh": "怎么会！两位已经不愿意再教我性感的秘诀了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1051_046rio", "source_sha256": "c02ce18cefc755a569c87c982820fe8cc93fe1d735fceed951b886411e5dd621", "ja": "あら、セクシーの極意なら、詩花ちゃんにはもう\n身についてるはずよ！　そうでしょ、このみ姉さん？", "zh": "哎呀，关于性感的秘诀，小诗花明明应该已经\n掌握了才对呀！对吧，木实姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1052_039kon", "source_sha256": "0fb93b40c51ce624d3b2c78bd8973c96f8467fad0f00f1a9a233f544868b3ed8", "ja": "ええ！　詩花ちゃんなら、あとは大丈夫！\n自分と、自分のセクシーを信じてあげて！", "zh": "没错！如果是诗花的话，接下来就没问题了！相信自己，也相信自己的性感魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1053_201xxx", "source_sha256": "b8369d0cbb7f014e51ce1a30e68e1bb6d60a80386051347bedcabcef9ee7d771", "ja": "このみ師匠、莉緒師匠……わかりました！\n私、自分を信じて……この後の撮影もがんばります！", "zh": "好美师父、莉绪师父……我明白了！\n我会相信自己……接下来的拍摄也会加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1054_039kon", "source_sha256": "c723677e3ddaf5ac174e1eb2bb14b1e195b99a518757b96f94a2f2c5fe41e431", "ja": "その意気よ！　それじゃあ、行くわよ！\n莉緒ちゃん、{$P$}も！", "zh": "就是这股劲头！那我们出发吧！\n莉绪、小{$P$}也一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_03_1055_p", "source_sha256": "becdb43d37de8c0099475ff1d38233c1ee04ce205db04f6cb689b7c65406f5ac", "ja": "（このみさん、莉緒も……旅に出るって、\n一体どこへ行くつもりなんだろう……？）", "zh": "（这美小姐和莉绪也要去旅行……到底打算去哪里呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
